# Flushing a batch without consulting its decision.
MODULE: AbortedContributesNothingFlushesAbort
TARGET: AbortedContributesNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an aborted batch is flipped into the view
PERTURBS: FlushBatch

--- FIND
       IN IF decision[u] = "commit" /\ ~Registered(TxId(u))
--- REPLACE
       IN IF ~Registered(TxId(u))
--- END
